278
00:22:24,812 --> 00:22:26,247
With my fiancee.

279
00:22:26,314 --> 00:22:27,648
Where is she?

280
00:22:27,715 --> 00:22:28,950
Ohio.

281
00:22:37,625 --> 00:22:39,126
Come on.

282
00:22:47,367 --> 00:22:48,368
Come on.

283
00:23:07,655 --> 00:23:08,656
This through here is where

284
00:23:08,723 --> 00:23:11,125
