333
00:27:59,280 --> 00:28:00,515
Jon?

334
00:28:02,016 --> 00:28:03,184
Jon?

335
00:28:03,684 --> 00:28:05,152
Jon!

336
00:28:05,219 --> 00:28:06,820
You'll get through
the clouds in a moment.

337
00:28:06,887 --> 00:28:08,489
Just keep climbing.

338
00:28:08,557 --> 00:28:10,291
