341
00:28:29,843 --> 00:28:31,045
Now unclip.

342
00:28:40,020 --> 00:28:41,055
Hey.

343
00:28:41,722 --> 00:28:42,723
Yeah.

344
00:28:44,158 --> 00:28:45,292
You good?

345
00:28:45,359 --> 00:28:46,661
Yep.

346
00:28:46,727 --> 00:28:47,962
Thanks.

347
00:28:51,666 --> 00:28:52,667
You okay?

348
00:28:55,035 --> 00:28:56,070
Ladies.

349
