506
00:43:32,947 --> 00:43:34,248
The planks are gone.

507
00:43:36,484 --> 00:43:37,618
The planks are gone.

508
00:43:42,690 --> 00:43:43,757
Oh, my God!

509
00:43:43,824 --> 00:43:45,292
And I don't even have
a safety harness!

510
00:43:48,095 --> 00:43:50,998
Okay. All right, I got mine.
I'll secure you.

511
00:43:52,266 --> 00:43:54,235
I got you. I got you.

512
00:43:54,301 --> 00:43:55,736
- Okay?
- Okay.

513
00:43:58,339 --> 00:43:59,773
Okay, great.

514
00:43:59,840 --> 00:44:01,408
All right.

515
00:44:02,643 --> 00:44:04,078
Be careful.

516
00:44:05,446 --> 00:44:07,281
Be careful.

517
00:44:08,983 --> 00:44:11,018
