01:04:40,548 --> 01:04:41,649
God.

811
01:04:46,253 --> 01:04:48,055
-Can you get my phone for me?
-Mmm.

812
01:04:51,559 --> 01:04:53,093
I've been ignoring her calls.

813
01:04:54,161 --> 01:04:55,697
My poor mom.

814
01:04:55,764 --> 01:04:59,768
I can't face telling her
that I've stopped treatment.

815
01:05:01,736 --> 01:05:03,505
And I know she's so worried.

816
01:05:07,908 --> 01:05:10,444
And I wrote a text,

817
01:05:10,512 --> 01:05:14,281
but I didn't have it
in me to send it.

818
01:05:17,451 --> 01:05:19,621
And now she'll never know.

819
01:05:19,687 --> 01:05:21,556
Okay, listen to me.

820
01:05:21,623 --> 01:05:23,390
We're gonna make it down,

821
01:05:23,457 --> 01:05:25,459
and you are going to tell her
that in person.

822
01:05:25,527 --> 01:05:26,694
Okay?

823
01:05:26,761 --> 01:05:28,530
We are gonna make it
out of here alive.

824
01:05:28,596 --> 01:05:29,631
Mm-hmm.

825
01:05:52,386 --> 01:05:54,856
Shi! Shi? Shi?

826
01:05:54,923 --> 01:05:56,925
Shi! Shi!

827
01:05:56,990 --> 01:05:57,991
Wake up!

828
01:05:58,660 --> 01:05:59,694
Shi!

829
01:05:59,761 --> 01:06:01,161
Shi, wake up!

830
01:06:03,397 --> 01:06:04,566
Shi, wake up!

831
01:06:06,233 --> 01:06:08,068
Shi, wake up!

832
01:06:08,937 --> 01:06:12,239
Wake up! Please!

833
01:06:22,015 --> 01:06:23,518
Get me down now!

834
01:06:24,485 --> 01:06:25,854
You're okay.

835
01:06:26,955 --> 01:06:28,222
What the hell?

836
01:06:28,288 --> 01:06:29,423
You're an asshole!

837
01:06:29,490 --> 01:06:30,959
I thought I was going to die.

838
01:06:31,024 --> 01:06:33,962
Jax! Jax!
Come on, dude. Wait up!

839
01:06:34,027 --> 01:06:35,996
I was just trying to help you.

840
01:06:36,063 --> 01:06:38,065
How does scaring the hell
out of me help me?

841
01:06:38,131 --> 01:06:39,567
I wanted to show you that fear

842
01:06:39,634 --> 01:06:41,034
is something
that you can control.

843
01:06:41,101 --> 01:06:43,203
Stop trying to change me, okay?

844
01:06:43,270 --> 01:06:44,606
I'm not one of your followers!

845
01:06:44,672 --> 01:06:46,273
I don't need saving!

846
01:06:47,341 --> 01:06:48,475
I love you.

847
01:06:48,543 --> 01:06:49,978
Okay? I want you to stop letting

848
01:06:50,043 --> 01:06:51,813
everybody walk all over you.

849
01:06:51,880 --> 01:06:53,480
What? Like you?

850
01:06:53,548 --> 01:06:54,549
No.

851
01:06:56,383 --> 01:06:58,051
No, I'm sorry!

852
01:06:58,118 --> 01:07:00,522
Okay? I just want you to learn
how to stand up for yourself!

853
01:07:00,889 --> 01:07:02,389
Okay.

854
01:07:02,456 --> 01:07:03,558
How's this, Shi?

855
01:07:03,625 --> 01:07:05,192
Drop dead!

856
01:07:15,803 --> 01:07:16,905
Hey.

857
01:07:17,839 --> 01:07:18,840
Hey.

858
01:07:24,311 --> 01:07:25,312
Wake up.

859
01:07:31,653 --> 01:07:33,086
Wake up, wake up.

860
01:07:33,153 --> 01:07:35,723
Please wake up. Wake up, please.

861
01:07:37,692 --> 01:07:41,328
Please wake up.
Please wake up. Please.

862
01:07:43,998 --> 01:07:45,499
Wake up!

863
01:08:26,641 --> 01:08:27,709
Hey.

864
01:08:28,610 --> 01:08:30,578
How are you feeling?

865
01:08:30,645 --> 01:08:33,881
Like I've been hit
by a thousand trucks.

866
01:08:37,150 --> 01:08:39,053
You look like your sister
with that hair.

867
01:08:41,623 --> 01:08:43,190
I'm gonna get the radio,

868
01:08:43,256 --> 01:08:44,959
-and get us out of here.
-What?

869
01:08:46,561 --> 01:08:47,629
How?

870
01:08:48,930 --> 01:08:50,430
I can do it.

871
01:08:54,002 --> 01:08:55,003
I can do it.

872
01:09:00,541 --> 01:09:03,410
Okay, well, you're gonna need
all the rope you can get.

873
01:09:05,079 --> 01:09:06,313
Take it.

874
01:09:16,156 --> 01:09:17,157
Hey.

875
01:09:18,993 --> 01:09:20,028
What's your real name?

876
01:09:22,664 --> 01:09:23,698
It's Billie.

877
01:09:26,034 --> 01:09:27,334
Nice to meet you, Billie.

878
01:09:34,207 --> 01:09:36,144
Be careful, Jax.

879
01:09:36,209 --> 01:09:38,278
- Please?
- Yeah.

880
01:10:09,342 --> 01:10:11,311
Easy, easy.

881
01:11:19,279 --> 01:11:20,413
<i>Shi!</i>

882
01:11:20,480 --> 01:11:21,582
<i>Shi, look at me!</i>

883
01:11:23,251 --> 01:11:24,652
Shi, look!

884
01:11:25,920 --> 01:11:26,921
Shi!

885
01:11:43,137 --> 01:11:44,471
Go, Jax.

886
01:11:53,681 --> 01:11:55,583
Come on, you got this, Jaxie.

887
01:12:09,997 --> 01:12:12,066
Ooh!

888
01:12:12,133 --> 01:12:13,734
Oh! Shit.

889
01:12:15,169 --> 01:12:18,105
Oh, no!
The rope's not long enough.

890
01:12:18,172 --> 01:12:19,439
Jax, it's too far.
Just come back.

891
01:12:19,507 --> 01:12:22,176
Just turn back. It's too far!

892
01:12:25,513 --> 01:12:26,914
Jax!

893
01:12:29,449 --> 01:12:31,185
Jax, what are you doing?

894
01:13:53,935 --> 01:13:56,737
Oh, my God,
I could kiss you right now.

895
01:14:05,780 --> 01:14:06,981
Easy, easy.

896
01:14:10,584 --> 01:14:12,253
Jon, can you hear me?

897
01:14:14,422 --> 01:14:15,656
Jon?

898
01:14:17,258 --> 01:14:18,359
Jon?

899
01:14:27,467 --> 01:14:30,037
<i>- Jax, is that you?</i>
- Oh, my God.

900
01:14:30,104 --> 01:14:32,440
<i>Holy shit, you okay?</i>

901
01:14:32,506 --> 01:14:33,941
Yeah, I'm okay.

902
01:14:34,008 --> 01:14:35,876
Uh, Luce is pretty hurt.

903
01:14:35,943 --> 01:14:38,679
- We're stuck on the mountain.
<i>- Where are you?</i>

904
01:14:38,746 --> 01:14:41,382
- We're at the Devil's Elbow.
<i>- What?</i>

905
01:14:41,449 --> 01:14:42,717
<i>I tried to look for you</i>
<i>that way,</i>

906
01:14:42,783 --> 01:14:44,719
<i>but the whole place looked</i>
<i>totally destroyed.</i>

907
01:14:44,785 --> 01:14:46,587
Yeah, it pretty much is.

908
01:14:46,654 --> 01:14:48,723
- Where are you?
<i>- I'm at the peak.</i>

909
01:14:48,789 --> 01:14:50,191
<i>The Myanmar route down,</i>

910
01:14:50,257 --> 01:14:51,892
<i>it's completely wrecked</i>
<i>by the earthquake.</i>

911
01:14:51,959 --> 01:14:54,428
<i>It's gone. Please tell me</i>
<i>one of you has a working cell.</i>

912
01:14:54,494 --> 01:14:55,629
<i>Mine's dead.</i>

913
01:14:55,696 --> 01:14:57,698
Yeah, I do. I got one bar.

914
01:14:57,765 --> 01:14:59,700
<i>Okay, okay. I'm gonna</i>
<i>find a way to come to you.</i>

915
01:14:59,767 --> 01:15:00,968
<i>Make the call myself.</i>

916
01:15:01,035 --> 01:15:02,636
<i>Look, just sit tight.</i>
<i>It's gonna be okay.</i>

917
01:15:02,703 --> 01:15:04,372
Okay, please hurry.

918
01:15:05,606 --> 01:15:06,774
- Oh, my God.
- Oh, my God.

919
01:15:06,841 --> 01:15:08,876
We're going home!

920
01:15:23,991 --> 01:15:25,726
So you guys just gonna
sit around all day,

921
01:15:25,793 --> 01:15:27,461
or we gonna get
off this mountain?

922
01:15:27,528 --> 01:15:28,763
Jon!

923
01:15:28,829 --> 01:15:30,564
Oh, my God!

924
01:15:30,631 --> 01:15:32,133
Finally!

925
01:15:32,199 --> 01:15:34,135
Holy shit!

926
01:15:34,201 --> 01:15:35,503
It's good to see you guys.

927
01:15:44,245 --> 01:15:46,047
Give me your arm, okay?

928
01:15:52,753 --> 01:15:53,888
You made it.

929
01:16:02,531 --> 01:16:04,198
Okay. Okay, Captain.

930
01:16:10,871 --> 01:16:12,807
They're sending us a helicopter.

931
01:16:14,108 --> 01:16:15,142
There you go.

932
01:16:15,209 --> 01:16:16,677
They're gonna meet us
at the peak,

933
01:16:16,744 --> 01:16:18,279
so just have to make
our way there and wait.

934
01:16:18,345 --> 01:16:19,380
Okay?

935
01:16:19,880 --> 01:16:21,115
Let's go.

936
01:16:31,526 --> 01:16:33,427
Remember to clip in
and clip out.

937
01:16:35,062 --> 01:16:36,130
Yes.

938
01:16:37,198 --> 01:16:38,199
Oh.

939
01:16:44,271 --> 01:16:45,906
Oh, wow.

940
01:16:50,978 --> 01:16:52,646
You know, they say
when you reach the dragon...

941
01:16:52,713 --> 01:16:54,381
It eats your fears?

942
01:17:51,272 --> 01:17:52,373
Love you, Shi.

943
01:18:14,695 --> 01:18:15,963
Final crossing.

944
01:18:19,333 --> 01:18:21,402
It can't take
too much weight,

945
01:18:21,468 --> 01:18:22,970
so we have to go one at a time.

946
01:18:24,805 --> 01:18:26,040
I'll go first.

947
01:18:31,845 --> 01:18:33,414
Jesus, Jon.

948
01:18:33,480 --> 01:18:35,650
Just keep it together,
okay, Luce?

949
01:18:35,716 --> 01:18:36,850
It might be damaged,

950
01:18:36,917 --> 01:18:38,520
but it's just 40 feet
and then freedom.

951
01:18:46,060 --> 01:18:48,028
-This is crazy.
-Yeah, go slow.

952
01:19:02,743 --> 01:19:04,845
Yeah, you're good.

953
01:19:31,573 --> 01:19:32,574
Come on, Jax!

954
01:19:53,060 --> 01:19:54,395
This is crazy.

955
01:19:57,931 --> 01:19:59,300
You got it!

956
01:20:19,186 --> 01:20:21,188
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

957
01:20:21,255 --> 01:20:22,557
Jax!

958
01:20:22,624 --> 01:20:24,291
Jax!

959
01:20:24,358 --> 01:20:25,459
Whoa!

960
01:20:26,360 --> 01:20:27,928
It's coming down!

961
01:20:27,995 --> 01:20:29,597
- Jax!
- Run!

962
01:20:34,935 --> 01:20:36,705
-Jax!
-Thanks.

963
01:20:36,771 --> 01:20:38,439
You're welcome.

964
01:20:38,506 --> 01:20:40,074
Okay, we're almost there.

965
01:20:40,140 --> 01:20:41,975
Can we just rest a second?

966
01:20:42,042 --> 01:20:43,177
Yeah.

967
01:20:43,877 --> 01:20:45,012
Sure.

968
01:20:45,946 --> 01:20:46,947
Oh!

969
01:20:50,050 --> 01:20:51,151
Oh!

970
01:20:51,218 --> 01:20:53,287
I am gonna have some O2.

971
01:20:56,023 --> 01:20:57,124
What's in this thing?

972
01:20:57,191 --> 01:21:00,227
Oh, yeah,
I think that one's, uh, empty.

973
01:21:08,837 --> 01:21:09,903
What is this?

974
01:21:13,508 --> 01:21:15,008
What is this, Jon?

975
01:21:20,515 --> 01:21:21,516
Fentanyl.

976
01:21:22,550 --> 01:21:23,852
You must be joking.

977
01:21:25,018 --> 01:21:26,220
Why?

978
01:21:27,555 --> 01:21:30,324
Why use us as drug mules?

979
01:21:30,391 --> 01:21:32,794
It wasn't personal.

980
01:21:32,861 --> 01:21:36,063
Tourists find me,
want a memorable trip.

981
01:21:37,097 --> 01:21:38,332
So I give them one.

982
01:21:40,401 --> 01:21:42,970
And then they give me cover

983
01:21:43,036 --> 01:21:44,972
so I don't look suspicious
on my own.

984
01:21:45,038 --> 01:21:46,708
They never find out.

985
01:21:46,775 --> 01:21:50,377
And they go home safe, happy.

986
01:21:52,212 --> 01:21:53,213
No one gets hurt.

987
01:21:53,280 --> 01:21:55,015
They don't give you cover.

988
01:21:56,684 --> 01:21:57,685
You take it.

989
01:21:58,753 --> 01:22:00,487
Also, if we got caught,

990
01:22:00,555 --> 01:22:03,457
we'd spend the rest
of our lives in a Thai prison.

991
01:22:05,225 --> 01:22:06,694
Come on.

992
01:22:06,761 --> 01:22:08,563
You knew the risks.

993
01:22:08,630 --> 01:22:10,732
You are on an illegal hike.

994
01:22:11,932 --> 01:22:13,233
You were ready to break
the law for that.

995
01:22:13,300 --> 01:22:15,302
That's not the same thing.

996
01:22:15,369 --> 01:22:16,805
We chose to do that.

997
01:22:16,871 --> 01:22:17,872
Exactly.

998
01:22:17,938 --> 01:22:20,374
You can't even
take responsibility.

999
01:22:21,709 --> 01:22:22,911
You're a pathetic coward.

1000
01:22:24,411 --> 01:22:25,880
Coward?

1001
01:22:25,946 --> 01:22:27,981
I saved your lives.

1002
01:22:28,048 --> 01:22:30,652
In fact,
I risked mine to save yours.

1003
01:22:30,718 --> 01:22:32,119
So you should be thanking me.

1004
01:22:32,821 --> 01:22:34,021
He's crazy.

1005
01:22:34,087 --> 01:22:37,257
Okay, you didn't risk
your life to save us.

1006
01:22:37,324 --> 01:22:39,159
You risked it for this shit.

1007
01:22:40,160 --> 01:22:41,361
You know what?

1008
01:22:41,428 --> 01:22:42,564
You're gonna be thanking me
for this.

1009
01:22:42,630 --> 01:22:43,698
No, no, no, no, no.

1010
01:22:43,765 --> 01:22:45,132
No!

1011
01:22:47,802 --> 01:22:49,169
You're finished.

1012
01:23:10,123 --> 01:23:11,425
Oh, God.

1013
01:23:13,126 --> 01:23:14,394
Why did she do that?

1014
01:23:14,461 --> 01:23:16,430
-She didn't have to do that.
-What did you do?

1015
01:23:16,497 --> 01:23:18,098
You were never meant to see
what was in those tanks.

1016
01:23:19,801 --> 01:23:21,569
I mean, I can't go to jail here.

1017
01:23:21,636 --> 01:23:22,937
Jax, I can't.

1018
01:23:23,003 --> 01:23:24,037
I mean, you don't know what

1019
01:23:24,104 --> 01:23:25,105
they do to people
in prison here.

1020
01:23:25,172 --> 01:23:27,307
-You're a psychopath.
-No, no.

1021
01:23:29,276 --> 01:23:30,277
No, she fell.

1022
01:23:31,178 --> 01:23:32,212
I mean, accidents happen

1023
01:23:32,279 --> 01:23:33,882
all the time
on this mountain, so...

1024
01:23:40,487 --> 01:23:41,623
-No, no!
-Jax, don't!

1025
01:23:41,689 --> 01:23:43,257
You stay right there,
or I will drop it,

1026
01:23:43,323 --> 01:23:44,659
I swear to God.

1027
01:23:44,726 --> 01:23:46,861
Stay right there until
the emergency services arrive.

1028
01:23:54,067 --> 01:23:55,537
They're not coming, are they?

1029
01:23:57,504 --> 01:23:58,907
There is a helicopter coming.

1030
01:24:00,642 --> 01:24:02,342
But it's
not the emergency services.

1031
01:24:04,077 --> 01:24:06,915
And the cost of that ride
is what is in that tank.

1032
01:24:08,181 --> 01:24:10,250
So do not be stupid.

1033
01:24:10,317 --> 01:24:11,819
Look,

1034
01:24:11,886 --> 01:24:14,022
the first couple of times
you fail a delivery,

1035
01:24:15,489 --> 01:24:17,792
you lose a finger.

1036
01:24:17,859 --> 01:24:19,359
The third time, it's your head.

1037
01:24:20,728 --> 01:24:22,931
I'm just trying to survive
like everyone else.

1038
01:24:22,997 --> 01:24:24,431
So put down the canister.

1039
01:24:28,502 --> 01:24:29,503
No.

1040
01:24:31,171 --> 01:24:32,774
You're a fucking coward.

1041
01:24:35,242 --> 01:24:36,443
I'm not afraid of you.

1042
01:25:20,888 --> 01:25:22,056
You made me do this.

1043
01:25:22,957 --> 01:25:24,391
This didn't have to be so hard.

1044
01:26:48,408 --> 01:26:49,577
Clip in...

1045
01:26:50,343 --> 01:26:51,913
Clip out.

1046
01:28:28,676 --> 01:28:31,179
Two whiskeys, straight.

1047
01:29:06,147 --> 01:29:07,281
Thanks, Billie.
